(SMALL WORLD - Demo Rulebook \(Board Game Cafe\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(OVERVIEW) Tj T*
(The world is too small for everyone. Players choose a fantasy race with a special) Tj T*
(power, conquer regions, and later put the race in decline to start a new one. Coins) Tj T*
(are victory points.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(CHOOSING A RACE) Tj T*
(Six race and power combinations are visible. The first one is free. To take a lower) Tj T*
(one, put 1 coin on each combination you skip; you gain the coins lying on the) Tj T*
(combination you take.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(CONQUERING) Tj T*
(- Your first conquest with a new race must be a region on the edge of the map.) Tj T*
(- Conquering a region costs 2 race tokens plus 1 for each token, mountain, fortress or) Tj T*
(   other piece) Tj T*
(in it. Seas and lakes can not be conquered normally.) Tj T*
(- The defender loses 1 token and takes the rest back to redeploy at the end of your) Tj T*
(   turn.) Tj T*
(- Final conquest: if you lack tokens, roll the reinforcement die once and add its) Tj T*
(   result.) Tj T*
(At the end of your turn you may redeploy your tokens among your regions.) Tj T*
ET
