(DECLINE) Tj T*
(Instead of conquering, you may put your active race into decline: flip its banner and) Tj T*
(keep one token per region. A race in decline does not conquer any more but still) Tj T*
(scores. You may only have one race in decline; an older declined race is removed. On) Tj T*
(your next turn you choose a new race.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(SCORING) Tj T*
(At the end of each turn, earn 1 coin for each region you occupy, plus bonuses from) Tj T*
(your race and special power.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(GAME LENGTH) Tj T*
(The game lasts 10 turns with 2 or 3 players, 9 turns with 4 players and 8 turns with 5) Tj T*
(players. The player with the most coins at the end wins. Coins are kept face down) Tj T*
(until the end.) Tj T*
ET
